---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Validates a workspace and releases independently configured apps

Usage: leptoskit workspace [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  explain  Shows app boundaries, readiness order, call bindings and evidence gaps
  check    Rejects invalid graphs, escaping paths and conflicting managed identities
  plan     Freeze application configurations and independently pinned artifacts
  deploy   Apply an independently pinned plan, revalidating unchanged releases
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --app-target <NAME>  Select a named target from the root leptoskit.toml
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
